lass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in procedural dungeons: Beneath the city lies a huge network of dungeons and catacombs. Measure yourself against these dangers to become stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own build with each run: unlock effigies and upgrade with each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 biomes with different creatures and bosses: nightmares take many different forms, face yours.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Vespera Bononia is a fast-paced action-roguelite set in an ever-changing city. Fight as nightmares come to life and switch classes as a shifting soul. Master a mix of third-person shooter, magic and bullet hell to survive.",
